# Numeric Edge Cases

This repo is a collection of numeric edge cases for testing numeric operations.

## Running the Tests

To run the tests: `npm test` (or `yarn test`) and then open http://localhost:1337/tests/

## Adding New Test Data

The format should be:
```
"test name": {
  "description": "",
  "code": ""
}
```

If you're adding new numbers to the list, make sure they are formatted in scientific notation with at least two digits after the decimal point.
